# Loyalty comp points — an ExactOdds casino rule pack.
#
# Comp points are a currency, and every currency needs an audited mint.
# This program is the mint: every $1.00 wagered earns 1 point, every point
# redeems for 1 cent. The player can replay their whole wagering history
# through this program and land on the exact point balance the casino shows.
#
# Rules: earn = wagered / 100 (integer division floors — 99 cents wagered
# earns nothing). Redeem = points cents, 1 point = 1 cent, no rounding.
# No floats anywhere — floats can't be exact.

def comp_earn(wagered_cents: int) -> int do
    ret wagered_cents / 100
end

def comp_redeem(points: int) -> int do
    ret points
end

# Audited cases.
say(comp_earn(2550))
say(comp_earn(99))
say(comp_redeem(2500))
say(comp_redeem(0))
